{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:b84ec014ad54478e","name":"Climbing Claws","source":{"id":"source:reference-b84ec014ad54478e","title":"Climbing Claws","revision":18034,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T19:28:43Z","sha256":"9092b79f25c7bab1cada738e7ee0cc774eb68896cc4a81ba8e5ca987d833196d","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=18034","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Climbing%20Claws&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-b84ec014ad54478e","blocks":[{"tag":"h4","children":["Droid System"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," Appendage Cost x 2\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Requires:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hand"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hand","referenceId":"reference:fa18c06733fbbf41"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Claw"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Claw","referenceId":"reference:587cfbbbcd42a71b"}," Appendage\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Claws designed to grip a surface can be added to any Droid with a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hand"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hand","referenceId":"reference:fa18c06733fbbf41"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Claw"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Claw","referenceId":"reference:587cfbbbcd42a71b"}," Appendage. Climbing Claws grant the Droid a Climb Speed equal to one-half of its base ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speed","referenceId":"reference:c372fee9b4566b85"},". In addition, a Droid equipped with Climbing Claws may reroll a failed ",{"tag":"a","children":["Climb"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Climb","referenceId":"reference:98ca5f27d9642dc7"}," check (keeping the better result) and can ",{"tag":"a","children":["Take 10"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Take_10"}," on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Climb"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Climb","referenceId":"reference:98ca5f27d9642dc7"}," checks even when rushed or threatened. While in use, a Climbing Claw cannot be used for any other action. Climbing Claws double the cost of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Appendage"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Appendage"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Armor Upgrade"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scum and Villainy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scum_and_Villainy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 200\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Upgrade Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Upgrade_Point"}," Cost:"]}," 1\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Climbing Claws are retractable spikes worked into the arms and legs of a suit of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Armor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Armor"},". When wearing this ",{"tag":"a","children":["Armor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Armor"},", you gain a Climb Speed equal to one-half your your armored Walking Speed. Additionally, you can reroll a failed ",{"tag":"a","children":["Climb"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Climb","referenceId":"reference:98ca5f27d9642dc7"}," check (keeping the better of the two results) and can ",{"tag":"a","children":["Take 10"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Take_10"}," on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Climb"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Climb","referenceId":"reference:98ca5f27d9642dc7"}," checks even when rushed or threatened.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The wearer can use Climbing Claws to attack foes in melee. They count as being weapons two sizes smaller than the wearer, and they deal Slashing damage equal to the base Claw damage for a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Beast"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Beast","referenceId":"reference:628bf77a740094a9"}," of that size. For example, a Medium character would have Tiny Climbing Claws that deal 1d4 points of Slashing damage. If you are proficient with the suit of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Armor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Armor"}," you're wearing, you are proficient with any Climbing Claws installed on it.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
